	[Tooltip("The date this migration draws its line at: equipment bought BEFORE it entitles the player to the general it belongs to. Authored here and pushed to Title Data by Sync General Equipment, so the client and the server judge the same players the same way.

It used to be DateTime.UtcNow, evaluated on the client at call time, while the server read whatever the last push had frozen. The two could not agree: any equipment bought after the last push qualified on the client and not on the server, so the client asked for a grant the server would always refuse вЂ” and, because the request was retriggered by its own inventory refresh, asked forever. That is what rate-limited a tester's inventory API and emptied his client.

